<title>INDIA: Indian prime minister's address delayed.</title>
<headline>Indian prime minister's address delayed.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A speech by Prime Minister H.D. Deve Gowda, scheduled for 1700 hours IST (1130 GMT) at a meeting of the All India Association of Industries, has been delayed, delegates at the meeting said on Monday.</p>
<p>Reuters is covering the event.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
